  Simulator screenshots and demo recordings were produced by this project.
  The system architecture figure uses direct image crops from project
  simulator screenshots (docs/assets/demo/poster-easy.jpg and
  asset/display/20260703-005006.jpg) inside a source-code-driven native SVG.
  Its remaining geometry, labels, data, formulas, and arrows are authored as
  native SVG vector elements; the HTML file is a white preview wrapper. No
  generative image elements are used.

